<item>
            <title>[LU-20536] export import state in procfs for LWP connections.</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20536</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;LWP connections unlike MDC or OSC, do not export import state history and some other parts of the internal state to /procfs.  Having an access to LWP import state history, ptlrpc connection NIDs sometimes is very useful for debugging LWP/quota problems.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
